  <h2>What you're submitting today</h2>
  <p class="sub">Submit your locked topic with its justification, plus whatever you have of source one. Feedback only: no bands on this one.</p>
  <div class="submission-callout">
    <div class="label">Topic lock + first source (submit by end of class)</div>
    <p>Three things. Your <strong>topic</strong>. Two or three sentences on <strong>why it is genuinely contested</strong>, naming the two positions that disagree. And your <strong>first source</strong> with its OPVL started, however far you got.</p>
    <p>The justification matters more than it looks. A topic where you cannot name two opposing positions will not survive the synthesis in Block 6, and it is much cheaper to discover that today.</p>
